{"schemaVersion":"hanamesh.catalog.v1","generatedAt":"2026-10-25T15:39:09.546Z","items":[{"id":"18464043-983d-43cc-9c38-a958e2888157","name":"dsh-remote-web","displayName":"dsh-remote#dsh-remote-web","summary":"手机浏览器远程控制 dsh web，人在哪都能用（免公网 IP）：官方托管中继 4G 即用，也可自建 relay；一条命令安装电脑端 bridge 与设置页「远程控制」面板（云端/自建切换、账号登录、bridge 启停、反馈）；隧道数据面端到端加密（E2EE：手机↔电脑端正文与 WS 内容加密，中继只见路由元数据；支持扫码/一次性链接桌面授权，免重复输密码）；HTTP/WebSocket 全量透传，访问密钥认证、实时设备列表、可选流量配额。","description":"Remote control for dsh web from a phone browser, from anywhere (no public IP needed): hosted cloud relay works over 4G, or self-host the router; one command installs the desktop bridge and this in-harness Settings panel (cloud/self-hosted tabs, account login, bridge start/stop, feedback); the tunnel data plane is end-to-end encrypted (E2EE phone↔desktop, with a QR / one-time-link desktop grant so you never re-type the password), with HTTP/WebSocket pass-through, access-key auth, a live device list and optional traffic quotas.","homepage":"https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com/p/mrRisega/dsh-remote--packages-dsh-remote-web/","latestVersion":"0.7.1","categories":["remote"],"repository":{"url":"https://github.com/mrRisega/dsh-remote"},"package":{"registry":"npm","name":"dsh-remote-web"},"publisher":{"name":"mrRisega"},"updatedAt":"2026-10-25T15:39:03.000Z","itemId":"18464043-983d-43cc-9c38-a958e2888157","packageName":"dsh-remote-web","official":false,"catalogKind":"plugin","source":{"sourceId":"hanamesh","sourceRef":"market-snapshot/1e6fb94b-506a-4b23-a04b-f61c1d42f098","sourceLinks":[{"sourceId":"hanamesh","sourceRef":"market-snapshot/1e6fb94b-506a-4b23-a04b-f61c1d42f098","sourceUrl":"https://market.hanamesh.com/v1/plugins","firstSeenAt":"2026-10-25T15:39:03.509Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-25T15:39:03.509Z"}]}},{"id":"3afc5f8d-0eb0-4f7a-a7b1-d86d43f8eef9","name":"dsh-pentester","displayName":"dsh-pentester","summary":"基于 PTES 的渗透测试插件，采用 Root-Orchestrator 架构，用于 DeepSeek Harness。","description":"PTES-based penetration testing plugin with R