r for DeepSeek Harness, with a cat that sits in the corner of the Web GUI. A focus cycle of 30-90 minutes ends in a centered overlay plus a triple chime that gets you up to walk and drink; the later button answers with one real sourced case about prolonged sitting and one about dehydration (built-in library of 17 entries, each with publisher, date and a link to the original); stopping produces a session report with worked time, completed rounds, successful interruptions, snoozes, suggested drinks and a good/mid/bad grade. The cat can be dragged anywhere with its position remembered and loops one animation per state. The timer and the ledger live in the host half, so a page refresh never loses a cycle; it only reminds while a DSH page is open. Cycle lengths, chime volume, cat opacity and grade thresholds are configurable on the plugin settings page.","homepage":"https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com/p/wangzhanchao883/dsh-no-long-sit/","latestVersion":"0.1.3","categories":["notify"],"repository":{"url":"https://github.com/wangzhanchao883/dsh-no-long-sit"},"package":{"registry":"npm","name":"dsh-no-long-sit"},"publisher":{"name":"wangzhanchao883"},"updatedAt":"2026-10-25T15:39:03.000Z","itemId":"48af9297-b7a1-41a0-a237-885b7e1d44af","packageName":"dsh-no-long-sit","official":false,"catalogKind":"plugin","source":{"sourceId":"hanamesh","sourceRef":"market-snapshot/0f61d5d7-30b0-483c-ae36-a562bdf67a4f","sourceLinks":[{"sourceId":"hanamesh","sourceRef":"market-snapshot/0f61d5d7-30b0-483c-ae36-a562bdf67a4f","sourceUrl":"https://market.hanamesh.com/v1/plugins","firstSeenAt":"2026-10-25T15:39:03.512Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-25T15:39:03.512Z"}]}},{"id":"5fcf11d6-a255-4f94-8c3d-69f117e6728f","name":"@feng0531/dsh-vcs","displayName":"dsh-vcs","summary":"在 DeepSeek Harness 内只读审阅 Git 与 SVN 变更，支持仓库浏览和并排差异对比。","description":"Read-only Git and SVN change review inside DeepSeek Harness, with repository browsing and side-by-side diffs.","homepage":"https://awesome-dsh-plugin.com/p/f-e-n-g-053